Package: atelier16S
Type: Package
Title: Install Everything for the 16S Microbiome Workshop (PRC Lung Cancer, ISBST)
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Alif", "Chebbi", email = "alif.chebbi@isbst.uma.tn",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2770-1013"))
Description: Installing this package installs all the R and Bioconductor packages
    used in the 16S rRNA microbiome workshop of the PRC "Microbiote et cancer du
    poumon" (ISBST, Universite de la Manouba, 13 November 2026): DADA2, phyloseq,
    DESeq2, vegan and their companions. It also provides a function that checks the
    installation and a function that downloads the workshop materials.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/alifchebbi/PRC-lung-microbiome-training
BugReports: https://github.com/alifchebbi/PRC-lung-microbiome-training/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports:
    dada2,
    phyloseq,
    DESeq2,
    Biostrings,
    ShortRead,
    decontam,
    microbiome,
    vegan,
    ggplot2,
    dplyr,
